OL,3,AThree dead after family get into
OL,4,Adifficulty in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitnesses described seeing large
OL,7,Fnumbers of emergency vehicles and
OL,8,Fhelicopters arriving at the seafront as
OL,9,Fcoastguard crews, RNLI lifeboats, air
OL,10,Fambulances, police officers and
OL,11,Fambulance crews responded.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
