OL,3,ASacked Ukrainian defence minister calls
OL,4,Afor presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFedorov, who did not mention Zelensky
OL,7,Fby name in the video, was unexpectedly
OL,8,Ffired from his role as defence minister
OL,9,Fin late July, just six months after his
OL,10,Fappointment.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
