OL,3,AEarthquake rocks Spain's historic
OL,4,AGranada, injuring three
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least three people have been lightly
OL,7,Finjured and a number of buildings
OL,8,Fdamaged after an earthquake rocked
OL,9,Fsouthern Spain.
OL,11,FThe epicentre of the magnitude 4.8
OL,12,Ftremor on Tuesday morning was about
OL,13,F10km (six miles) south of the historic
OL,14,Fcity of Granada, the country's National
OL,15,FGeographic Institute (IGN) said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
