OL,3,AEarthquake rocks Spain's historic
OL,4,AGranada, injuring three
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany local residents were seen rushing
OL,7,Fout of their homes into the streets,
OL,8,Ffearing strong aftershocks. A number of
OL,9,Fvehicles were damaged by falling
OL,10,Fdebris. Some museums, administrative
OL,11,Fbuildings and sports centres have been
OL,12,Fforced to close.
OL,14,FThe IGN said it was the latest in a
OL,15,Fseries of very shallow tremors in the
OL,16,Farea that started last Friday and were
OL,17,Fwidely felt.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
