OL,3,ABrazil's President Lula hails oil
OL,4,Adiscovery near Amazon river
OL,5,
OL,6,FLula, who is running for another
OL,7,Ffour-year term in elections scheduled
OL,8,Ffor October, stressed that he was still
OL,9,Fcommitted to eventually phasing out
OL,10,Ffossil fuels to curb climate change.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
